{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20017","headline":"分水岭别夜示从弟寂 · 孟郊","name":"分水岭别夜示从弟寂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南中少平地，山水重叠生。\n别泉万余曲，迷舟独难行。\n四际乱峰合，一眺千虑幷。\n潺湲冬夏冷，光彩昼夜明。\n赏心难久胜，离肠忽自惊。\n古木摇霁色，高风动秋声。\n饮尔一樽酒，慰我百忧轻。\n嘉期何处定，此晨堪寄情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}